messages:
maria_docs: Hey — PR #324 (quickstart TS) has a broken auth example where we show a `refresh()` call that doesn't exist in SDK v3. Can someone pick this up?

alex_dev: on it. Which file path?

maria_docs: docs/quickstart/typescript-auth.md — snippet is using legacy patterns, plus the env var name is inconsistent with other quickstarts.

alex_dev: I think the minimal fix is to replace the pseudo `refresh()` with an explicit fetch using the new `tokens.rotate()` helper, and unify env var to `REDWOOD_API_KEY`. I'll patch the snippet.

sam_platform: heads-up: Dedicated runtime changed the streaming endpoint shape last week. If the snippet includes streaming examples we should call out "not available on Dedicated v1" or show fallback non-streaming code.

maria_docs: good catch. Current snippet is non-streaming but has `stream: true` comment. I'll remove that and add a note.

ci-bot: link-checker failed on PR #324: docs/quickstart/typescript-auth.md -> broken link to /sdk/migration/v2-to-v3.

alex_dev: I'll add an anchor to the migration guide and update the link. Also switching the snippet to this quick pattern:

```ts
// minimal auth + call (SDK v3+)
import { RedwoodClient } from '@redwood/inference';
const client = new RedwoodClient({ apiKey: process.env.REDWOOD_API_KEY });

async function run() {
  const resp = await client.text.generate({ model: 'redwood-alpha-1', input: 'Hello from Quickstart' });
  console.log(resp.output[0].text);
}
run().catch(console.error);
```

alex_dev: That avoids refresh/token rotation complexity for the quickstart. For teams needing long-lived flows we'll add a short appendix with `tokens.rotate()` and server-side examples.

jen_prod: FYI, make sure we don't print keys or show `REDWOOD_API_KEY` inline; use env var only and call it out in the preamble. We got a security nudge earlier.

maria_docs: noted — will add a security callout and an example of using a server-side token exchange.

alex_dev: PR updated -> link fixes + snippet replacement + comment about Dedicated streaming. Pinged for review.

maria_docs: reviewing now. If green I'll merge and backport to "starter-app" quickstart. Thanks all :rocket:

ci-bot: build/status: checks passed for PR #324 (docs).
